---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Guides
heading: Guides for residents' groups
description: Practical guides for tenants' and residents' associations in Sandwell, from starting a group to running an AGM.
lede: Practical, plain-English guides for setting up and running a residents' group. Each one can be printed.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <ol class="guide-list">
      {% for g in collections.guide | sort(false, false, "data.order") %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ g.url }}">
          <span class="guide-list__num">{{ "0" + loop.index }}</span>
          <span class="guide-list__title">{{ g.data.title }}</span>
          <span class="guide-list__summary">{{ g.data.summary }}</span>
          <span class="guide-list__meta">{{ g.data.readingTime }} read</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="panel mt-l">
      <h2>Need something that isn't here?</h2>
      <p>Call us on <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or <a href="/contact/">send us a message</a>. We can also provide guides in large print or another format.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
